Third-party work in this plugin
-------------------------------

- tools/skintokens.patch carries the edits of scripts/patch_skintokens_portable.py from
  image-to-3dlab (AssetFurnace), Copyright 2026 Bingeljell and image-to-3dlab
  contributors, https://github.com/Bingeljell/image-to-3dlab, licensed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Changed here:
  written out as one git diff against the pinned SkinTokens commit.
- tools/photo_project.py adapts the confidence tests (visibility, facing fade, outline,
  inner-edge and cut-out fades), their defaults and the UV-gutter growth of
  image_to_3dlab/photo_paint.py from image-to-3dlab (AssetFurnace), Copyright 2026
  Bingeljell and image-to-3dlab contributors, https://github.com/Bingeljell/image-to-3dlab,
  Apache License, Version 2.0. Changed here: re-written on Blender's mesh and image I/O,
  a camera fitted to the photo's silhouette, an exposure gain instead of the raw pixels,
  part exclusions and a stencil erase.

Third-party software kiln installs but does not ship
----------------------------------------------------

- SkinTokens / TokenRig (VAST-AI-Research), code and checkpoints MIT, cloned and
  downloaded by `tools/autorig.py setup` after the user agrees. Its language model is
  configured from Qwen3-0.6B (Apache-2.0); only the config and tokenizer are downloaded.
